## Module Entry Point

`F{{MODULE_NAME}}Module` implements `IModuleInterface`:

```cpp
class F{{MODULE_NAME}}Module : public IModuleInterface
{
public:
    virtual void StartupModule() override;
    virtual void ShutdownModule() override;
};
```

- `StartupModule()` — Register subsystems, bind delegates, initialize services
- `ShutdownModule()` — Unregister, unbind, clean up (reverse order of startup)

